  "referenceNumber": "CYB0124",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that OOO IMPULS is or has been involved in relevant cyber activity, by being responsible for, engaging in, providing support for, or promoting the commission, planning or preparation of relevant cyber activity and by providing technical assistance that could contribute to relevant cyber activity. Additionally, OOO IMPULS remains associated with GRU Unit 29155, which is a person who is or has been so involved in such activity. \nThe activity that OOO IMPULS is or has been involved in undermines, or is intended to undermine, the integrity, prosperity or security of the United Kingdom or a country other than the United Kingdom.\n",
